ts/Challenges/Requirement\";\r\n\r\n<ChallengeTitle>Pinocchio Escrow</ChallengeTitle>\r\n\r\nIt's now time to put what you've learned to the test. Using what you've learned from the lesson, build an escrow program using the Pinocchio framework that satisfies the following requirements:\r\n\r\n<RequirementList>\r\n  <Requirement title=\"Challenge 1: Making an escrow offer\">\r\n    Your program should allow a maker to make an escrow offer. Define an instruction to do this using an instruction discriminator with value `0`.\r\n  </Requirement>\r\n\r\n  <Requirement title=\"Challenge 2: Taking an escrow offer\">\r\n    Your program should allow a taker to take an escrow offer. Define an instruction to do this using an instruction discriminator value of `1`.\r\n  </Requirement>\r\n\r\n  <Requirement title=\"Challenge 3: Canceling an escrow offer\">\r\n    Your program should allow the maker to cancel an escrow offer and refund the escrowed funds. Make sure your instruction is defined with an instruction discriminator value of `2`.\r\n  </Requirement>\r\n</RequirementList>\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}